      "contextAfter": "`context`: A pointer to the structure into which the context information for `port` is to be copied. The information being returned is usually the same information you passed to [`CFMachPortCreate(_:_:_:_:)`](cfmachportcreate(_:_:_:_:).md) or [`CFMachPortCreateWithPort(_:_:_:_:_:)`](cfmachportcreatewithport(_:_:_:_:_:).md) when creating `port`. However, if [`CFMachPortCreateWithPort(_:_:_:_:_:)`](cfmachportcreatewithport(_:_:_:_:_:).md) returned a cached CFMachPort object instead of creating a new object, `context` is filled with information from the original CFMachPort object instead of the information you passed to the function.",
